+  gUefiPayloadThirdPartyImageEventGroupGuid   ## PRODUCES ## Event
+
+[Protocols]
+  gEfiFirmwareVolume2ProtocolGuid             ## SOMETIMES_CONSUMES
+  gEfiPciIoProtocolGuid                       ## SOMETIMES_CONSUMES
